WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.735
Plan where and how you will sell, before you harvest.

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:08.899
Ask buyers at nearby markets what they want: fresh roots, gari, fufu or flour.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:12.635
Compare prices, and the cost of transport.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:17.421
Think about selling together with other farmers, to reach bigger buyers.

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:22.790
Write down what you spend and what you earn. Records help you plan next season.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:31.595
Before you move on, check: Talk to at least two buyers. Decide: fresh or processed. Start a record book.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:40.002
Well done. You have finished the course. Now complete the practical activity, and plan your own cassava plot.
